<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Clojure on tik</title><link>https://tik.projects.metio.wtf/tags/clojure/</link><description>Recent content in Clojure on tik</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://tik.projects.metio.wtf/tags/clojure/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Clojure library</title><link>https://tik.projects.metio.wtf/integrations/library/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tik.projects.metio.wtf/integrations/library/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;tik.api&lt;/code&gt; gives a JVM, babashka or native-image program the answers of&#10;&lt;code&gt;tik status&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;tik verify&lt;/code&gt; for one ticket without running the CLI. It&#10;never writes to the store, signs, runs a probe, touches the network or&#10;starts a process.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-clojure" data-lang="clojure"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;require&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;tik.api&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ss"&gt;:as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;api&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;])&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;def &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;store&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;api/open-store&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;/path/to/.tik&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;; the dir holding tickets/ or tik.db&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;api/derive&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;store&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;f106aa78&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;;; =&amp;gt; {:ticket #uuid &amp;#34;f106aa78-…&amp;#34; :title &amp;#34;…&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;;; :rules {:process :skilled-change :version 2 :hash &amp;#34;sha256-…&amp;#34;}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;;; :current [:scoped] :reached [:scoped]&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;;; :facts {[:kind] {:status :present :value :feat :by &amp;#34;claude&amp;#34;} …}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;;; :missing-parents nil&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;;; :definition {:pinned &amp;#34;sha256-…&amp;#34; :derived-under &amp;#34;sha256-…&amp;#34; :source :archive}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;;; :at #inst &amp;#34;…&amp;#34;}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ss"&gt;:ok?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;api/verify-ticket&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;store&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;f106aa78&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add tik as a git dependency in &lt;code&gt;deps.edn&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>